# Third-party components

This project bundles and depends on third-party material whose own licenses
continue to apply. Anonymising a submission does not remove the obligation to
preserve these notices.

## gym-invmgmt (multi-echelon simulator)

A declared, pinned dependency (`gym-invmgmt==0.2.1`), installed from its
published release rather than vendored into this repository. It is MIT
licensed; its own distribution carries its copyright notice and licence text,
which are unmodified by this project.

This project previously vendored a fork of that package. Distributing the fork
placed a third-party LICENSE naming its copyright holder inside a double-blind
submission artifact. Depending on the published release and citing it in third
person removes that link without altering anyone's copyright notice, which
would not have been a permissible way to achieve anonymity.

## Templates, corpora and original code

Everything outside `third_party/` -- the simulator wrappers, interpreters,
retrieval implementation, warning and report templates, experiment runners,
metrics and analysis code -- is original to this project and released under the
MIT License in `LICENSE`.

## Model artifacts

`results/retrieval/frozen_embeddings.json` contains sentence embeddings
produced by `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` (Apache-2.0). The model
weights themselves are not redistributed here; only derived vectors for this
project's own texts are included.

`results/frozen_llm_outputs/` contains canonical parsed JSON responses from
commercial language-model APIs, retained for offline reproduction of the
published results. Provider terms govern their reuse.
